                        "entry_id": "54b5cda4-4507-32ff-bff0-77305a3bc6d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of fabric made of interwoven cloth strips, native to Ghana."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "67cbb0f6-1f3e-4e5d-a98b-c4031f4e4743",
                                "sense_id": "25445486-5410-304f-97bf-b9f9598f7699",
                                "text": "One trend shaping up for spring is an abundance of graphic black and white textiles that recall Op Art paintings, or messed up checkerboards. Mr. Panichgul’s were subtle, made of patchwork ticking stripes, but Ms. Cornejo’s looked almost as if she had recolored traditional kente cloth for her inviting wraps and a one-shouldered sheath. […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8999edd4-3dff-4ca1-af77-08f03753ef91",
                                "sense_id": "25445486-5410-304f-97bf-b9f9598f7699",
                                "text": "And there were others that four years later you cringe to remember: the black squares on social media, Nancy Pelosi taking the knee wearing kente cloth, Keir Starmer and Angela Rayner also taking the knee while looking soberly into the camera."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
